ve any question regarding the item.\nMeasurements provided are approximate aims to indicate size/weight, and color representation may differ from in person with different lighting. Additionally, multi-disc media/ANY item that is a set may be incomplete, and buyers should verify state laws regarding the sale and purchase of gun magazines, which can vary. Silver/gold tone listed items have no actual fine sterling or solid gold/plated items in the lots and are mainly fashion/costume jewelry. If an item is AUTHENTICATED, it is by LegitMark and will have a COA, or CERTIFICATE OF AUTHENTICITY\nOur employees at HOT Goodwill Ecommerce use their knowledge, research skills, and Google Lens to provide most answers in the listing. While observations/efforts are made to accurately describe items, we DO NOT CLAIM EXPERTISE on any given field and may overlook details. If you have any questions about information not provided by our photos or our descriptions or item/seller/shipping tabs, please SUBMIT A CUSTOMER SERVICE TICKET and we will be happy to assist you.",
